<view class="container onboarding-page {{isElderMode ? 'elder-mode' : ''}}">
  <view class="onboarding-title">加入社区服务团队</view><view class="onboarding-note">先申请入驻，再提交专业资质。审核通过后开通工作人员身份，初始为休息状态。</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在获取申请进度…</view>
  <view class="card" wx:elif="{{failed}}"><view>申请进度加载失败</view><button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card" wx:if="{{isStaff || (application && application.status === 'APPROVED')}}"><view class="onboarding-heading">{{statusText || '已开通工作人员身份'}}</view><view class="onboarding-note">进入工作台后，请在「我的资质证明」上传证书。技能审核和排班完成后，才可参与对应服务派单。</view><button class="btn-primary onboarding-action" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="activate">更新身份并进入工作台</button></view>
    <view class="card" wx:elif="{{application && application.status === 'PENDING'}}"><view class="onboarding-heading">{{statusText}}</view><view class="onboarding-note">申请人：{{application.realName}}<view>服务区域：{{application.serviceArea}}</view>审核期间仍保留居民身份，无需重复提交。</view><button class="btn-secondary onboarding-action" bindtap="load">刷新审核结果</button></view>
    <view class="card" wx:else>
      <view class="onboarding-reason" wx:if="{{application && application.auditReason}}">退回原因：{{application.auditReason}}</view>
      <view class="onboarding-label">姓名</view><input class="onboarding-input" data-key="realName" value="{{form.realName}}" maxlength="32" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy}}" />
      <view class="onboarding-label">手机号码</view><input class="onboarding-input" data-key="phone" type="number" value="{{form.phone}}" maxlength="11" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy}}" />
      <view class="onboarding-label">服务区域</view><input class="onboarding-input" data-key="serviceArea" value="{{form.serviceArea}}" maxlength="100" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy}}" />
      <view class="onboarding-label">服务经历与申请说明</view><textarea class="onboarding-input" data-key="introduction" value="{{form.introduction}}" maxlength="500" bindinput="onInput" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="说明可提供的服务、相关经历和可服务时段" />
      <view class="onboarding-note">通过后此账号转为工作人员身份。请填写本人使用且未关联其他账号的手机号码；专业证书在入驻后单独提交审核。</view>
      <button class="btn-primary onboarding-action" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{application ? '补充资料并重新申请' : '提交入驻申请'}}</button>
    </view>
  </block>
  <button wx:if="{{!loading && !isStaff && (!application || application.status !== 'APPROVED')}}" class="btn-secondary onboarding-action" bindtap="goToProfile" disabled="{{busy}}">返回个人中心</button>
</view>
